      "prefLabel": "C-dealkylation",
      "inScheme": "xmet:scheme",
      "definition": "Oxidative cleavage of a carbon–carbon bond with loss of an alkyl fragment (xenobiotic C-dealkylation). Chemically oxidative C–C cleavage, not N-/O-/S-dealkylation. Alcohol- and carbonyl-level cleavage patterns share this home; ox-state via alwaysWith. Quaternary site child for quaternary C–C alcohol-level cleavage.",
