      "prefLabel": "diol formation",
      "inScheme": "xmet:scheme",
      "definition": "Formation of a 1,2-diol. Mechanism-spanning umbrella: cis routes (e.g. dioxygenase cis-dihydroxylation) and trans routes (e.g. epoxide hydration to a trans-dihydrodiol). Reaction-class term (product stereochemistry specialized below), not a descriptor facet.",
      "altLabel": [
