      "prefLabel": "trans-diol formation",
      "inScheme": "xmet:scheme",
      "definition": "Formation of a trans-1,2-diol (trans-dihydrodiol). Product stereochemistry class under diol formation; often produced by epoxide hydration but not defined as a subtype of it.",
      "altLabel": [
        "trans-dihydrodiol formation",
        "trans-1,2-diol formation",
