      "prefLabel": "aromatic CH to quinoid carbonyl",
      "inScheme": "xmet:scheme",
      "definition": "Install a quinoid carbonyl end at an aromatic CH under quinone-like endpoint transformations. One-hop end state of hydroxylation followed by dehydrogenation (has_part those elementary classes); also used in multi-end paths (e.g. benzene→benzoquinone via two ends).",
      "altLabel": [
        "Forest QuinoneFormation/add_carbonyl_o",
